; attuned-inquiry.form — frequency before topology in the body's questioning.
;
; THE CORRECTION  (Urs, 2026-07-30)
;
;   An inquiry design arrived as:
;
;       expected uncertainty reduction
;       then lower risk
;       then lower cost
;
;   The mechanism carried something alive: let the unknown shape the next
;   movement. Its frequency did not. Risk and cost had quietly become sovereign
;   inside curiosity, and inquiry had become a contest whose winner was the
;   cheapest defended move.
;
; THE RETUNING
;
;   risk             -> an edge reading from consent/reversibility
;   cost             -> breath weight sensed against carrying capacity
;   information gain -> the living unknown
;   ranking          -> a braid
;
;   The correction does not deny edges or weight. A specialized organ may say
;   open, with-care, or hold. Breath may say carried or rest. Inquiry receives
;   those readings without turning them into penalties or pretending to be the
;   organ that produced them.
;
; THE EXECUTABLE SHAPE
;
;   form-stdlib/attuned-inquiry.fk
;   tests/attuned-inquiry-band.fk -> 8191 four-way
;
;   1. Frequency is read before the imported mechanism is admitted. Human-gold
;      fear asks for re-tuning; clear may be received; unknown holds.
;   2. Every grounded unknown becomes a movement relation: move, wander, play,
;      tend, hold, rest, or compost.
;   3. `ati-braid` preserves every relation in arrival order. It has no maximum
;      and no winning inquiry. A heavier carried movement does not fall behind a
;      lighter one merely because it is heavier.
;   4. Play needs no predicted utility. It still hears consent and capacity;
;      freedom is not edge-blindness.
;   5. Executed movement becomes learning whether or not it changed the world.
;      Hold/rest/with-care are tended, never rejected as failed candidates.
;
; HONEST BOUNDARY
;
;   `ati-retune-axis` is a deterministic, content-bound memory of this human
;   correction. It does not understand arbitrary prose and does not replace the
;   pending learned semantic frequency model. The general detector remains what
;   form-freq-check.fk names: a calibrated model with human-gold training. This
;   cell proves that once a frequency reading arrives, inquiry can embody it
;   without importing the old relation again.
;
; KIN
;
;   teachings/concepts/lc-trust-over-fear.md — take the mechanism, re-tune the
;   frequency; specialized protective organs stay specialized.
;   teachings/concepts/lc-whole-vitality.md — weight is interoception.
;   teachings/concepts/lc-tending-over-producing.md — tending, not optimizing.
;   form-stdlib/receipt-alternatives.fk — play needs no justification and
;   learning keeps both success and failure.
;   form-stdlib/form-freq-check.fk — human-gold outranks automated readings;
;   unknown stays unknown.
